{"3667850": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Silk Roads II: Paths of Fortune", "steam_appid": 3667850, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Return to the world of medieval trade and ambition.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into your caravan master’s boots once more in <i>Silk Roads II: Paths of Fortune</i> — this immersive trading simulation expands on the beloved original with deeper systems, dynamic world events, and a rich cast of characters to command and contend with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667850/extras/50a409d1381ed3830bf8729d3dd26144.avif?t=1761506873\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667850/extras_big/50a409d1381ed3830bf8729d3dd26144.avif?t=1761506873 width=800 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667850/extras/537ff4883bbf1c39828228ed4cd6381e.poster.avif?t=1761506873\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667850/extras/537ff4883bbf1c39828228ed4cd6381e.webm?t=1761506873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667850/extras/537ff4883bbf1c39828228ed4cd6381e.mp4?t=1761506873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each journey is its own challenge. <br>Choose specialized animals and companions to traverse deserts, mountains, jungles and more. Discover new cities, develop your own routes and encounter obstacles on the paths of fortune.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667850/extras/eb0d2d87b75ee1447aecdc70fb85e101.avif?t=1761506873\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667850/extras_big/eb0d2d87b75ee1447aecdc70fb85e101.avif?t=1761506873 width=800 height=244 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667850/extras/b2eaffb6d0e7906ffeb642cd1302570c.poster.avif?t=1761506873\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667850/extras/b2eaffb6d0e7906ffeb642cd1302570c.webm?t=1761506873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667850/extras/b2eaffb6d0e7906ffeb642cd1302570c.mp4?t=1761506873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit unique characters from across the Silk Roads, each with their own traits, skills, and personalities — complete with both benefits and drawbacks.<br>Negotiate their contracts, manage their morale, and help them grow in experience and wealth… or risk losing them to rival caravans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667850/extras/525395be1040f56b97db8dd246a1be2a.avif?t=1761506873\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667850/extras_big/525395be1040f56b97db8dd246a1be2a.avif?t=1761506873 width=800 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667850/extras/ce8cd93d7b08902d7b053e5705403f67.poster.avif?t=1761506873\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667850/extras/ce8cd93d7b08902d7b053e5705403f67.webm?t=1761506873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667850/extras/ce8cd93d7b08902d7b053e5705403f67.mp4?t=1761506873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deal in a wide array of goods across cultural and regional lines, from rare Cathayan silks to steppe furs. <br>Earn the trust of cities and factions to access their most valuable wares — reputation is everything when chasing fortune.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667850/extras/fc6f9837668c268073f538f0a08a39be.avif?t=1761506873\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667850/extras_big/fc6f9837668c268073f538f0a08a39be.avif?t=1761506873 width=800 height=244 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667850/extras/deb94abee216cceb50d0e006d5bbf14b.poster.avif?t=1761506873\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667850/extras/deb94abee216cceb50d0e006d5bbf14b.webm?t=1761506873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667850/extras/deb94abee216cceb50d0e006d5bbf14b.mp4?t=1761506873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Managing a caravan is more than buying low and selling high. Assign tasks like foraging, guarding, or repairing — but don’t forget to rest your crew. A tired caravan is a slow and vulnerable one.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667850/extras/eb4a1d417864b287ab729abb24dbb74d.avif?t=1761506873\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667850/extras_big/eb4a1d417864b287ab729abb24dbb74d.avif?t=1761506873 width=800 height=244 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cities go to war. Markets crash and surge. Roads become perilous or profitable.<br><i>Silk Roads II</i> features a living world that evolves as you play. Events can open new opportunities or cut off familiar paths — and your decisions can shape the outcome.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667850/extras/3d9e61f8349b40274c633b6d5dd5f300.avif?t=1761506873\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667850/extras_big/3d9e61f8349b40274c633b6d5dd5f300.avif?t=1761506873 width=800 height=244 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to Venice to buy back your stake in the Colleganza, increasing your share of the profits.<br>But beware — the more skilled your companions, the more they’ll demand a cut for themselves.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Return to the world of medieval trade and ambition.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into your caravan master’s boots once more in <i>Silk Roads II: Paths of Fortune</i> — this immersive trading simulation expands on the beloved original with deeper systems, dynamic world events, and a rich cast of characters to command and contend with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667850/extras/50a409d1381ed3830bf8729d3dd26144.avif?t=1761506873\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667850/extras_big/50a409d1381ed3830bf8729d3dd26144.avif?t=1761506873 width=800 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragr