y back your stake in the Colleganza, increasing your share of the profits.<br>But beware — the more skilled your companions, the more they’ll demand a cut for themselves.</p>", "short_description": "Hire companions, master trade routes and build relationships as you forge a path of trade through the medieval world in Silk Roads II: Paths of Fortune - a colourful trading sim that uses real history to present you with a view of the life of a medieval merchant in the times of Marco Polo.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667850/7a9162a5387cb56bf8bd69f1538259b9d6f8089f/header.jpg?t=1761506873", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667850/d396d23bf0a5d1fd3215d5e70bf2f506bc4daadf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761506873", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667850/d396d23bf0a5d1fd3215d5e70bf2f506bc4daadf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761506873", "website": "https://www.priorygames.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS Catalina</li></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu or Similar</li></ul>"}, "developers": ["Priory Games"], "publishers": ["Priory Games"], "demos": [{"appid": 3781660, "description": ""}], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 999, "final": 999, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$9.99"}, "packages": [1292120], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy Silk Roads II: Paths of Fortune", "description": "", "selection_text": "Select a